Package: libcareplus
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: userspace live patching tools
 LibcarePlus applies patches to a running userspace process without
 restarting it. It attaches to the target with ptrace, loads a prebuilt
 .kpatch object into the process address space and redirects the entry
 point of each patched function to its replacement.
 .
 This package provides libcare-ctl, used on a device to apply and query
 live patches, and the toolchain used to build .kpatch objects
 (libcare-patch-make, libcare-cc, libcare-cxx, kpatch_gensrc,
 kpatch_strip, kpatch_make).
